& \eqref{eq:4.3} \\
\NSi{NS-F-P019-007}{E,U,V_0,\Pi}
& Leading profiles of swirl, axial velocity, radial flux \NSi{NS-F-P019-008}{ru_r^{(0)}}, and pressure, respectively.
& \eqref{eq:4.3}, \eqref{eq:4.7} \\
